    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49869.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 70,
    "turn_text": "Yeah. Tell me, because you've been on both sides, member and staffer, what would staff members learn if they, if this were an episode of trading places and they spent a month as the member and then transported back to being staffer? What insights would they gain that would be helpful?",
