    "turn_text": "he's terrific. He once told me that another member described being a member as being a television set where somebody else changes the channel all the time. That's great. And it's mentally exhausting. I mean, all of us who are just dealing with Zoom conference fatigue during COVID, I do think that that is something that is so difficult to appreciate. And frankly, probably impossible to fully appreciate as a staffer until you've lived it. But having some visibility into that life would make people better at managing the member and managing the full staff to deliver what the member needs.",
