    "turn_idx": 92,
    "turn_text": "So I launched the Institute of Politics and Global Affairs at Cornell University and it's meant to kind of break through this volatile and highly tribalized political environment that we're in and deepen discourse and raise understanding. And so we have prominent global and national leaders do events for us. I had Ryan Sprebus and I also had Speaker Nancy Pelosi, Congressman Tom Cole and Congressman Adam Schiff, Senator Bill Cassidy and Senator Amy Klobuchar. And so we try and create kind of a bipartisan exploration of issues without all the screaming and yelling. We're based in New York City, and for anybody who's interested in participating in our many programs, our website address, if I may put in the plug, is IOPGA.coranel.edu. It's IOPGA.coranel.edu. And I'm serious. I'm going to call you and ask you to participate in one of our panels.",
