    "turn_text": "I would be happy to. And so tell me this, the undergraduates that are participating, they may look at you and panelists they bring in and think to themselves, and that is the other side of the universe. I love this politics thing. I think I'd want to do it. I'm not sure I could ever get there. What advice would you give them?",
